    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/167c8ccca8dcc874794900a2fb480bf3.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=133 /></span><br>Step into the mystical realm of Sacred Forest, where pixel art meets adrenaline-fueled action in a vibrant open-world adventure tailored for the bold and the brave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/8bc587215a63f943fd8ab005dc254ab5.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/8bc587215a63f943fd8ab005dc254ab5.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/8bc587215a63f943fd8ab005dc254ab5.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As the spirited heroine of this pixelated odyssey, you'll wield your bow with the finesse of a seasoned marksman, navigating the lush 3D landscapes with a mix of agility and cunning. But your skills don't end there \u2013 with the ability to manipulate time itself, you'll slow it to a crawl, slipping into first-person mode to land those perfect shots with ease.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/83e6bcada3e9f364f4e3208fe7ac3ed2.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/83e6bcada3e9f364f4e3208fe7ac3ed2.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/83e6bcada3e9f364f4e3208fe7ac3ed2.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take to the skies on the flutter of your cape, gliding gracefully over the verdant canopy below, or unleash your inner daredevil with the thrill of grappling arrows, swinging through the forest like a modern-day superhero.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/4bb9973ef6ac985e3873c4ee44498052.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/4bb9973ef6ac985e3873c4ee44498052.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/4bb9973ef6ac985e3873c4ee44498052.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Yet, amidst the beauty lies a dark secret \u2013 a malevolent blight has tainted the once-idyllic forest, unleashing legions of monstrous creatures upon its unsuspecting inhabitants. These aren't your run-of-the-mill foes, but twisted manifestations of lost souls, hungry for chaos and destruction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/b927d9dfdd46cd0e4a6cf3876a4a085f.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/b927d9dfdd46cd0e4a6cf3876a4a085f.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/b927d9dfdd46cd0e4a6cf3876a4a085f.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's up to you, intrepid adventurer, to uncover the mysteries of the forest and restore peace to its troubled lands. Embark on epic quests, face off against colossal beasts, and forge alliances with the forest's denizens as you fight to reclaim its lost glory.<br><br>With its captivating blend of innovative gameplay mechanics, stunning visuals, and a rich, immersive narrative, Sacred Forest offers an unforgettable journey that will leave you breathless and begging for more. Are you ready to answer the call of adventure and become the hero this forest desperately needs?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/c15cdb0dce6738576163ad2198b42cb0.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=70 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/167c8ccca8dcc874794900a2fb480bf3.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=133 /></span><br>Step into the mystical realm of Sacred Forest, where pixel art meets adrenaline-fueled action in a vibrant open-world adventure tailored for the bold and the brave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/8bc587215a63f943fd8ab005dc254ab5.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/8bc587215a63f943fd8ab005dc254ab5.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/8bc587215a63f943fd8ab005dc254ab5.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As the spirited heroine of this pixelated odyssey, you'll wield your bow with the finesse of a seasoned marksman, navigating the lush 3D landscapes with a mix of agility and cunning. But your skills don't end there \u2013 with the ability to manipulate time itself, you'll slow it to a crawl, slipping into first-person mode to land those perfect shots with ease.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/83e6bcada3e9f364f4e3208fe7ac3ed2.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/83e6bcada3e9f364f4e3208fe7ac3ed2.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/83e6bcada3e9f364f4e3208fe7ac3ed2.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take to the skies on the flutter of your cape, gliding gracefully over the verdant canopy below, or unleash your inner daredevil with the thrill of grappling arrows, swinging through the forest like a modern-day superhero.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/4bb9973ef6ac985e3873c4ee44498052.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/4bb9973ef6ac985e3873c4ee44498052.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/4bb9973ef6ac985e3873c4ee44498052.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Yet, amidst the beauty lies a dark secret \u2013 a malevolent blight has tainted the once-idyllic forest, unleashing legions of monstrous creatures upon its unsuspecting inhabitants. These aren't your run-of-the-mill foes, but twisted manifestations of lost souls, hungry for chaos and destruction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/b927d9dfdd46cd0e4a6cf3876a4a085f.poster.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/b927d9dfdd46cd0e4a6cf3876a4a085f.webm?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/b927d9dfdd46cd0e4a6cf3876a4a085f.mp4?t=1724422933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's up to you, intrepid adventurer, to uncover the mysteries of the forest and restore peace to its troubled lands. Embark on epic quests, face off against colossal beasts, and forge alliances with the forest's denizens as you fight to reclaim its lost glory.<br><br>With its captivating blend of innovative gameplay mechanics, stunning visuals, and a rich, immersive narrative, Sacred Forest offers an unforgettable journey that will leave you breathless and begging for more. Are you ready to answer the call of adventure and become the hero this forest desperately needs?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864350/extras/c15cdb0dce6738576163ad2198b42cb0.avif?t=1724422933\" width=616 height=70 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an open world adventure in Sacred Forest! Play as a pixel art heroine, master slow-mo archery, glide with your cape, and swing with grapple arrows. Battle blight-infected monsters, undertake epic quests, and restore balance to the forest!",
